<section class="d-wrap buy" id="pro"><h2 class="d-h2 sm">Self-host Pro</h2><p>The Pro items on your server are {dollars(SELFHOST_PRO_YEARLY_MINOR)} a year per install, for use in your own business: remove the Docustay footer, and write your own Plays and Playbooks, with the Plays API. Unlimited documents, reminders, sending to a list and team roles are already in the free Community edition. Pay once a year; your licence key arrives by email, covers one install and renews itself while the subscription is paid. It does not cover embedding Docustay in a product you sell, white-labelling or resale: those need a <a href="/licensing">commercial licence</a>. A Pro licence is checked by the install and keeps working up to 30 days offline. This is an honour system, not copy protection.</p>
